110	course	AMST 3800	AMST 3800 Independent Study or Directed Reading in American Studies Intended for students who wish to conduct individual investigations related to American Studies. Not limited to American Studies students but should be under the supervision of an American Studies advisor or designate.	{"code": "AMST 3800", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
