446	course	BIOL 4144	BIOL 4144 Advanced Ecology Energy flow, nutrient cycles, community structure, population growth, and regulation. Three lecture hours and one laboratory period of three hours a week.	{"code": "BIOL 4144", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
