470	course	BIOL 4257	BIOL 4257 Microbial Physiology and Metabolism Lectures in microbial metabolism and physiology, including such topics as bacterial nutrition, transport mechanisms, catabolism and energy production, biosynthesis, global regulation of gene expression.	{"code": "BIOL 4257", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
