485	course	BIOL 4292	BIOL 4292 Advances in Immunology Current topics in immunology with particular emphasis upon the genetic systems and molecular mechanisms underlying immune reactions.	{"code": "BIOL 4292", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
