1561	course	ETFS 3144	ETFS 3144 Active Fire Protection Review of fire suppression, alarm, and smoke control systems. Topics include: fixed and portable suppression systems, fire suppression agents and extinguishing mechanisms, fire detection devices, fire protective detection and signaling systems, smoke production in fires and principles of smoke movement and management.	{"code": "ETFS 3144", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
