2208	course	INFO 3211	INFO 3211 Technical Support A study of technical support and help desk concepts. Emphasis on building skill sets in diagnosing and solving user and software related problems. Topics include: support management techniques, help desk operations, and support performance evaluation.	{"code": "INFO 3211", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
