2303	course	MKTG 3231	MKTG 3231 Global Marketing Management Building on the fundamentals of marketing, this course introduces the context of the global environment. The cultural, social, legal, political, financial and geographic dimensions of the global marketplace are examined. Using primarily qualitative methods, the impact and integration of global factors in marketing strategies is assessed.	{"code": "MKTG 3231", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
