2907	course	PHYS 1101L	PHYS 1101L Introductory Physics I Laboratory Laboratory investigations illustrating experimental techniques and fundamental principles of natural phenomena. Three laboratory hours each week. If a student has completed PHYS 2101L with grade of C or above in a previous semester, the student is exempted from taking PHYS 1101L. Three contact hours.	{"code": "PHYS 1101L", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
