2948	course	PHYS 4271	PHYS 4271 Waves and Optics Topics include: ray analysis of common optical elements, wave properties of light, the superposition of periodic and non-periodic waves, and selected topics from geometrical and physical optics.	{"code": "PHYS 4271", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
