3622	course	THEA 3225	THEA 3225 Theatre Tech II - Scenic An introduction to advanced methods, tools, and materials used in the creation of theatrical scenery. Safety methods and protocols are explored, and students focus on critical thinking, analytical, and problem-solving skills as they relate to scenery production.	{"code": "THEA 3225", "catalog": "Undergraduate 2026-2027"}	\N
