4491	occupation	45-2011.00	Agricultural Inspectors Inspect agricultural commodities, processing equipment, and facilities, and fish and logging operations, to ensure compliance with regulations and laws governing health, quality, and safety.	{"soc_code": "45-2011.00"}	\N
